{"title":"Skeleton Man-at-Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/grave-rivet\">Grave Rivet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>49</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>67</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>89</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>39</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>62</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"mute